(6220123, 919192, 29777, '<td valign="top">This is a tricky shot. Very well done. I think if the orange really "popped" in the shot that would make it a 10.</td>', 'This is a tricky shot. Very well done. I think if the orange really "popped" in the shot that would make it a 10.', '2010-11-11 14:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6220124, 918982, 29777, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. I''m looking for the blue to work against the orange and I am not finding it.</td>', 'I really like this shot. I''m looking for the blue to work against the orange and I am not finding it.', '2010-11-11 14:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6220126, 919174, 29777, '<td valign="top">Kind of retro. Usually I would not like the shallow DOF for a shot like this, but I like it here. It seems to add to the movement of water.</td>', 'Kind of retro. Usually I would not like the shallow DOF for a shot like this, but I like it here. It seems to add to the movement of water.', '2010-11-11 14:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
