(6220133, 919030, 29777, '<td valign="top">This meets the challenge and shows the texture very well. However, other than the texture, I''m not sure what the subject may be.</td>', 'This meets the challenge and shows the texture very well. However, other than the texture, I''m not sure what the subject may be.', '2010-11-11 15:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
