(6220221, 919137, 49716, '<td valign="top">Lovely blooms, but maybe not quite enough contrast,''punch'', and sharpness to score well on DPC.</td>', 'Lovely blooms, but maybe not quite enough contrast,''punch'', and sharpness to score well on DPC.', '2010-11-11 16:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6220224, 919189, 49716, '<td valign="top">It is brave to go with this in a ''colours'' challenge.  I hope it does OK for you.</td>', 'It is brave to go with this in a ''colours'' challenge.  I hope it does OK for you.', '2010-11-11 16:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6220228, 919185, 49716, '<td valign="top">Great colours here.  The reflections in the vases are a little distracting, but that''s basic editing for you :-)</td>', 'Great colours here.  The reflections in the vases are a little distracting, but that''s basic editing for you :-)', '2010-11-11 16:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6220231, 919094, 49716, '<td valign="top">A good natural capture.  I think some ''selective color'' adjustment would have allowed the orage/blue to be brought out even more.</td>', 'A good natural capture.  I think some ''selective color'' adjustment would have allowed the orage/blue to be brought out even more.', '2010-11-11 16:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6220234, 919192, 49716, '<td valign="top">Sharply observed and framed with excellent lighting.</td>', 'Sharply observed and framed with excellent lighting.', '2010-11-11 16:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6220237, 918958, 49716, '<td valign="top">Excellent stop frame capture.  Technically I don''t think orange and green are ''classic'' complimentary colours, but not a vote loser for me.</td>', 'Excellent stop frame capture.  Technically I don''t think orange and green are ''classic'' complimentary colours, but not a vote loser for me.', '2010-11-11 17:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6220238, 919074, 49716, '<td valign="top">Nice colours and composition.  A little more depth of field would have kept more of the subject sharp and improved the image for me.</td>', 'Nice colours and composition.  A little more depth of field would have kept more of the subject sharp and improved the image for me.', '2010-11-11 17:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6220240, 918947, 49716, '<td valign="top">Don''t know what it is - but I like it :-)</td>', 'Don''t know what it is - but I like it :-)', '2010-11-11 17:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6220255, 919082, 17507, '<td valign="top">Cleanly and elegantly presented. In my top 3. Too bad about the slight diffraction through the center of the glass and the uneven horizon line--still very strong.</td>', 'Cleanly and elegantly presented. In my top 3. Too bad about the slight diffraction through the center of the glass and the uneven horizon line--still very strong.', '2010-11-11 17:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6220256, 919129, 17507, '<td valign="top">The texture in the features is wonderful, and the color scheme is spot on. I do not like the pose, but the sharpness is quite appealing.</td>', 'The texture in the features is wonderful, and the color scheme is spot on. I do not like the pose, but the sharpness is quite appealing.', '2010-11-11 17:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6220258, 919169, 17507, '<td valign="top">Elegant and unusual. I think this could have benefited from advanced editing to get the peacock to pop a bit more. For some reason, the orange/blue scheme seems to be easiest to present strongly in this challenge... I like your creative choice of subject matter.</td>', 'Elegant and unusual. I think this could have benefited from advanced editing to get the peacock to pop a bit more. For some reason, the orange/blue scheme seems to be easiest to present strongly in this challenge... I like your creative choice of subject matter.', '2010-11-11 17:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6220259, 919109, 17507, '<td valign="top">Yellow/purple is hard to pull off well, but these colors are beautiful. Would have liked a more diffuse light source and more detail in the leaf.</td>', 'Yellow/purple is hard to pull off well, but these colors are beautiful. Would have liked a more diffuse light source and more detail in the leaf.', '2010-11-11 17:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6220260, 918842, 17507, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture. I think it could have stood to be cropped a bit more, and I must wonder why you didn''t use the full 800 pixels allowed.</td>', 'Very nice capture. I think it could have stood to be cropped a bit more, and I must wonder why you didn''t use the full 800 pixels allowed.', '2010-11-11 17:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6220261, 919185, 17507, '<td valign="top">Very nice--bold and brilliant. Although the overall impact is lessened somewhat by unsightly wrinkles in the fabric, the final image is still quite appealing.</td>', 'Very nice--bold and brilliant. Although the overall impact is lessened somewhat by unsightly wrinkles in the fabric, the final image is still quite appealing.', '2010-11-11 17:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
