hted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_588047.jpg"/></a> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=129214" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/288/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_129214.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/288/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_129214.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/288/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_129214.jpg"/></a> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=705373" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/886/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_705373.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/886/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_705373.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/886/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_705373.jpg"/></a> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=9154" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/44/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_9154.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/44/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_9154.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/44/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_9154.jpg"/></a> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=249920" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/397/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_249920.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/397/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_249920.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/397/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_249920.jpg"/></a> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=316628" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/474/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_316628.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/474/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_316628.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/474/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_316628.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>EDIT: I realize my comment might have come off a bit harsh. I don''t mean to detract from the picture itself, which is very well executed. It is just that I joined the site merely a few weeks ago, and from the few profiles and previous challenges I had looked through I felt I had already seen many of these shots, which was confirmed by a search for "glass". <br/> <br/>By no means let me take away from your motivation, this is a great shot! I love the small droplets breaking up the symmetry, and the choice of colors and lighting is impeccable. There is a slight bulge in the color line seen through the water as well as the "horizon line", and there seems to be some refractions of a white edge around the colored background, but those are minor details and don''t really detract that much from the picture.<br/> <br/>So, to summarize (and of course IMVHO): <br/>Execution: 8<br/>Originality: 1<br/> <br/>:)</td>', 'Nicely executed, but isn''t this theme a bit worn out?           EDIT: I realize my comment might have come off a bit harsh. I don''t mean to detract from the picture itself, which is very well executed. It is just that I joined the site merely a few weeks ago, and from the few profiles and previous challenges I had looked through I felt I had already seen many of these shots, which was confirmed by a search for "glass".  By no means let me take away from your motivation, this is a great shot! I love the small droplets breaking up the symmetry, and the choice of colors and lighting is impeccable. There is a slight bulge in the color line seen through the water as well as the "horizon line", and there seems to be some refractions of a white edge around the colored background, but those are minor details and don''t really detract that much from the picture. So, to summarize (and of course IMVHO): Execution: 8Originality: 1 :)', '2010-11-12 06:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6220695, 918915, 122591, '<td valign="top">As I commented on another picture in this challenge, this theme seems a bit worn out to me...<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=20998" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/96/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_20998.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/96/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_20998.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/96/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_20998.jpg"/></a> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=129270" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/288/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_129270.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/288/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_129270.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/288/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_129270.jpg"/></a> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=324586" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/484/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_324586.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/484/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_324586.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/484/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_324586.jpg"/></a> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=588047" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/75000-79999/76430/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_588047.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/75000-79999/76430/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_588047.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/75000-79999/76430/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_588047.jpg"/></a> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=129214" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/288/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_129214.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/288/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_129214.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/288/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_129214.jpg"/></a> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=705373" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/886/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_705373.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/886/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_705373.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/886/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_705373.jpg"/></a> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=9154" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/44/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_9154.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/44/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_9154.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/44/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_9154.jpg"/></a> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=249920" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/397/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_249920.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/397/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_249920.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/397/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_249920.jpg"/></a> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=316628" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/474/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_316628.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/474/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_316628.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/474/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_316628.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>EDIT: <br/>The previous comment might have come off a bit harsh. One of my first thoughts after looking through some previous challenges on the site was that this site has a weird obsession with wine glasses and cutlery (especially forks)! :P<br/> <br/>At least you are bringing a new element into the theme, which works pretty well. I love the sharpness of the petals, and the color of the flower is great in itself. I''d love to see a somewhat wider crop with the color line completely centered, as it is now it seems a little too far to the right and perhaps also leaning slightly.<br/> <br/>As for the challenge, I feel that the colors don''t quite fit. The color of the flower is neither completely red nor completely orange, and as such it doesn''t really complement neither the green or the blue from the background, though it might have worked as an "in-between" if the green and blue were darker or at least a bit more saturated.<br/> <br/>Still, those are just my 2 cents of course, and other people will probably have a different opinion :) Besides, I''m just a baby when it comes to photography, so you shouldn''t really put much weight on my opinion anyway :P</td>', 'As I commented on another picture in this challenge, this theme seems a bit worn out to me...           EDIT: The previous comment might have come off a bit harsh. One of my first thoughts after looking through some previous challenges on the site was that this site has a weird obsession with wine glasses and cutlery (especially forks)! :P At least you are bringing a new element into the theme, which works pretty well. I love the sharpness of the petals, and the color of the flower is great in itself. I''d love to see a somewhat wider crop with the color line completely centered, as it is now it seems a little too far to the right and perhaps also leaning slightly. As for the challenge, I feel that the colors don''t quite fit. The color of the flower is neither completely red nor completely orange, and as such it doesn''t really complement neither the green or the blue from the background, though it might have worked as an "in-between" if the green and blue were darker or at least a bit more saturated. Still, those are just my 2 cents of course, and other people will probably have a different opinion :) Besides, I''m just a baby when it comes to photography, so you shouldn''t really put much weight on my opinion anyway :P', '2010-11-12 06:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6220709, 919082, 113278, '<td valign="top">Wine glass and a water drop, all you are missing is a bug to make it a triple threat :) But seriously this is such a well done shot. The lighting is excellent, timing perfect and your attention to detail to set this up just right is great. My only 10 for this challenge. I will be very surprised if this doesn''t grab the blue with around a 7.5 average. Good luck.</td>', 'Wine glass and a water drop, all you are missing is a bug to make it a triple threat :) But seriously this is such a well done shot. The lighting is excellent, timing perfect and your attention to detail to set this up just right is great. My only 10 for this challenge. I will be very surprised if this doesn''t grab the blue with around a 7.5 average. Good luck.', '2010-11-12 07:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
