(6221578, 919082, 108580, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully setup, shot, exposed and processed. To get the drop perfectly aligned and split in half, well done. -1 for annoying dust spots.</td>', 'Wonderfully setup, shot, exposed and processed. To get the drop perfectly aligned and split in half, well done. -1 for annoying dust spots.', '2010-11-13 11:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
