(6222649, 919082, 94235, '<td valign="top">The split color in the drop adds immensely to this shot. Well captured. One of my top pics for this challenge.</td>', 'The split color in the drop adds immensely to this shot. Well captured. One of my top pics for this challenge.', '2010-11-14 23:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6222650, 918522, 94235, '<td valign="top">Subtle coloring but very effective. Great job. Should rate well.</td>', 'Subtle coloring but very effective. Great job. Should rate well.', '2010-11-14 23:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6223273, 919074, 114225, '<td valign="top">Goof idea for the challenge, I''m just not liking the overall execution much. Mainly,it seems the focus is a bit soft, I cannot see the details I would like to see.</td>', 'Goof idea for the challenge, I''m just not liking the overall execution much. Mainly,it seems the focus is a bit soft, I cannot see the details I would like to see.', '2010-11-15 09:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6223275, 918276, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea for the challenge. I would have liked to see this photo a bit brighter, especially on the leaves.</td>', 'Very nice idea for the challenge. I would have liked to see this photo a bit brighter, especially on the leaves.', '2010-11-15 09:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6223276, 918990, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like it. I know most people on''t appreciate the tilted view, but for a subject like this, it works.</td>', 'I like it. I know most people on''t appreciate the tilted view, but for a subject like this, it works.', '2010-11-15 09:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6223279, 918625, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea for this one. I would have cored it a bit higher if there wasn''t so much noise, and if the reflections weren''t visible.</td>', 'Very nice idea for this one. I would have cored it a bit higher if there wasn''t so much noise, and if the reflections weren''t visible.', '2010-11-15 09:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6223289, 919120, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Great focus and subject. I''m not at all a fan of the black border on the top/bottom. It''s making it feels like her head/chin were unintentionally cut off.</td>', 'Nicely done. Great focus and subject. I''m not at all a fan of the black border on the top/bottom. It''s making it feels like her head/chin were unintentionally cut off.', '2010-11-15 09:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6223295, 918350, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great subject and good use of depth of field. I would have scored this a point higher if the bird was lit a bit more, so I could see more details in the middle/lower feathers.</td>', 'Great subject and good use of depth of field. I would have scored this a point higher if the bird was lit a bit more, so I could see more details in the middle/lower feathers.', '2010-11-15 09:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6223299, 918970, 114225, '<td valign="top">I definitely like the idea you have here, but what''s with the distracting rain?</td>', 'I definitely like the idea you have here, but what''s with the distracting rain?', '2010-11-15 09:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6223300, 918958, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very well done. I know droplet shots are done a lot, but this mixture of colors is more unique and interesting.</td>', 'Very well done. I know droplet shots are done a lot, but this mixture of colors is more unique and interesting.', '2010-11-15 09:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6223315, 919192, 114225, '<td valign="top">Overall, a nice photo. Some things that could have brought the score up a bit: the depth of field is very shallow, I would like to see the details in the orange better. Also, the blown highlights on the orange are somewhat distracting.</td>', 'Overall, a nice photo. Some things that could have brought the score up a bit: the depth of field is very shallow, I would like to see the details in the orange better. Also, the blown highlights on the orange are somewhat distracting.', '2010-11-15 10:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6223324, 918444, 114225, '<td valign="top">Maybe the reference is lost on me, but what does the $10 bill have to do with this shot? It seems out of place and distracting. Otherwise, it''s a nice shot.</td>', 'Maybe the reference is lost on me, but what does the $10 bill have to do with this shot? It seems out of place and distracting. Otherwise, it''s a nice shot.', '2010-11-15 10:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6223331, 917986, 123293, '<td valign="top"><b>I think it would have look better without the person, but thats just me.</b></td>', 'I think it would have look better without the person, but thats just me.', '2010-11-15 10:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6223333, 919094, 114225, '<td valign="top">Excellently done. Great use of nature''s complementary colors.</td>', 'Excellently done. Great use of nature''s complementary colors.', '2010-11-15 10:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6223342, 918655, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very cool! I am curious to know how you did this. It looks like a colors adjustment in post, which is something that I''m working on learning now.</td>', 'Very cool! I am curious to know how you did this. It looks like a colors adjustment in post, which is something that I''m working on learning now.', '2010-11-15 10:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6223695, 919132, 114896, '<td valign="top">I like the pattern in the leaf. The two colors make it interesting.</td>', 'I like the pattern in the leaf. The two colors make it interesting.', '2010-11-15 16:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6223699, 919109, 114896, '<td valign="top">Love the yellow and purple colors together. I like the way the leaf fills the frame and the depth the shadow gives.</td>', 'Love the yellow and purple colors together. I like the way the leaf fills the frame and the depth the shadow gives.', '2010-11-15 16:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6223700, 919082, 114896, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully proportioned. Nice complimentary tones.</td>', 'Wonderfully proportioned. Nice complimentary tones.', '2010-11-15 16:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6223710, 918016, 114896, '<td valign="top">What a gorgeous sky. The moon really adds to the mood. That looks like a hot air balloon too. The skyline along the bottom is nicely balanced and makes a nice addition to the photo.</td>', 'What a gorgeous sky. The moon really adds to the mood. That looks like a hot air balloon too. The skyline along the bottom is nicely balanced and makes a nice addition to the photo.', '2010-11-15 16:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6223715, 919169, 114896, '<td valign="top">Great use of silver/white and gold. The scenery and statue play nicely off each other with similar pointy shapes.</td>', 'Great use of silver/white and gold. The scenery and statue play nicely off each other with similar pointy shapes.', '2010-11-15 17:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6223720, 918514, 114896, '<td valign="top">Everything goes with black. Nice smile and lighting.</td>', 'Everything goes with black. Nice smile and lighting.', '2010-11-15 17:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6223724, 918298, 61396, '<td valign="top">Thanks for daring and teaching me some German.</td>', 'Thanks for daring and teaching me some German.', '2010-11-15 17:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6223738, 918750, 114896, '<td valign="top">Beautiful flower. I like the background, gives interest without fighting with the orchid''s colors.</td>', 'Beautiful flower. I like the background, gives interest without fighting with the orchid''s colors.', '2010-11-15 17:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6223740, 918259, 114896, '<td valign="top">I like the focus point here. Really draws the eye to the center of the picture. These really do look good together, no wonder they are a holiday standard.</td>', 'I like the focus point here. Really draws the eye to the center of the picture. These really do look good together, no wonder they are a holiday standard.', '2010-11-15 17:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6223741, 918350, 114896, '<td valign="top">Great clarity. The detail of the feathers is great. What a great eye too. The background is perfect as well, very soft focus and perfect green.</td>', 'Great clarity. The detail of the feathers is great. What a great eye too. The background is perfect as well, very soft focus and perfect green.', '2010-11-15 17:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6223753, 918262, 114896, '<td valign="top">Wonderful color blend.</td>', 'Wonderful color blend.', '2010-11-15 17:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6223756, 918857, 114896, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed. I like the focus.</td>', 'Nicely composed. I like the focus.', '2010-11-15 17:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6223761, 919122, 114896, '<td valign="top">I like the red and green color against all the gray. Interesting pattern to the photo as well.</td>', 'I like the red and green color against all the gray. Interesting pattern to the photo as well.', '2010-11-15 17:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6223763, 919135, 114896, '<td valign="top">Lol, I like the title. Nice lighting and set up.</td>', 'Lol, I like the title. Nice lighting and set up.', '2010-11-15 17:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6223765, 918378, 114896, '<td valign="top">Creative idea. I like the water drops on the apple, give more interest.</td>', 'Creative idea. I like the water drops on the apple, give more interest.', '2010-11-15 17:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6223769, 918982, 114896, '<td valign="top">Great capture. The focus on the front petals and bug are great. I like the way the flower''s colors fill the frame.</td>', 'Great capture. The focus on the front petals and bug are great. I like the way the flower''s colors fill the frame.', '2010-11-15 17:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6223771, 919013, 114896, '<td valign="top">Nice effect from the ripples. I love the splash of color and reflection. The contrast between the softness of the water and crisp focus of the fishing thingie is nice too.</td>', 'Nice effect from the ripples. I love the splash of color and reflection. The contrast between the softness of the water and crisp focus of the fishing thingie is nice too.', '2010-11-15 17:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
