(6224095, 918352, 91783, '<td valign="top">once the challenge is over, i would love to see you set up and the equipment you used. <br/> <br/>Nice clean image. good luck!</td>', 'once the challenge is over, i would love to see you set up and the equipment you used.  Nice clean image. good luck!', '2010-11-16 00:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224182, 919133, 122131, '<td valign="top">I like the peppers ''embracing'' each other.<br/>I love their reflection and the negative space.<br/>I don''t particularly like the head of the green pepper though; it looks as if though it''s been chewed off..<br/><strike>I find it''s just a tad bit too dark on the bottom, too, to the point where it''s losing a bit too much detail.</strike> <br/>**Edit** On a better calibrated monitor, I''m able to see more detail on the bottom of the green pepper.<br/>The lighting is spot on.<br/> <br/>Overall, you did a great job, especially avoiding harsh highlights, and keeping the shot interesting and moody.<br/>9.</td>', 'I like the peppers ''embracing'' each other.I love their reflection and the negative space.I don''t particularly like the head of the green pepper though; it looks as if though it''s been chewed off..I find it''s just a tad bit too dark on the bottom, too, to the point where it''s losing a bit too much detail. **Edit** On a better calibrated monitor, I''m able to see more detail on the bottom of the green pepper.The lighting is spot on. Overall, you did a great job, especially avoiding harsh highlights, and keeping the shot interesting and moody.9.', '2010-11-16 06:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
