(6224853, 918510, 10275, '<td valign="top">This is a great image, but the black border lines do not fit well with this setup.</td>', 'This is a great image, but the black border lines do not fit well with this setup.', '2010-11-16 20:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224858, 919137, 10275, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful soft capture of the rose bush. I would have scored this higher if you didn''t have the thick black/white border combo around it. 7</td>', 'This is a beautiful soft capture of the rose bush. I would have scored this higher if you didn''t have the thick black/white border combo around it. 7', '2010-11-16 20:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224860, 919013, 10275, '<td valign="top">I love how simple this is. Very nice minimalism.</td>', 'I love how simple this is. Very nice minimalism.', '2010-11-16 20:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224861, 919094, 10275, '<td valign="top">The colour and clarity are very good. Sky is complimenting nicely, but you need to work on your composition. 7</td>', 'The colour and clarity are very good. Sky is complimenting nicely, but you need to work on your composition. 7', '2010-11-16 20:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224863, 919155, 10275, '<td valign="top">Beautiful detail on the bug. Nice complimentary colours. The rose petals are a bit overexposed (way too bright) and the bottom is blurry, which takes attention away from the bug.</td>', 'Beautiful detail on the bug. Nice complimentary colours. The rose petals are a bit overexposed (way too bright) and the bottom is blurry, which takes attention away from the bug.', '2010-11-16 20:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224869, 919192, 10275, '<td valign="top">This is such a beautiful photo. Love the composition, the detail and soft background. I would have given it the highest mark, if it weren''t for the thick border. This image would do well with thin border. 9</td>', 'This is such a beautiful photo. Love the composition, the detail and soft background. I would have given it the highest mark, if it weren''t for the thick border. This image would do well with thin border. 9', '2010-11-16 20:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224871, 918262, 10275, '<td valign="top">Lovely. I love how the black bottom balances the image well. Minimalism at it''s best.</td>', 'Lovely. I love how the black bottom balances the image well. Minimalism at it''s best.', '2010-11-16 20:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224872, 918056, 10275, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition.</td>', 'Beautiful composition.', '2010-11-16 20:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224874, 918658, 10275, '<td valign="top">The sun in the bottom corner is such a nice touch to this lovely image.</td>', 'The sun in the bottom corner is such a nice touch to this lovely image.', '2010-11-16 20:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224879, 919135, 10275, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. The detail on the glass is a nice touch. Like the composition as well. As a suggestion, tone down (darker or make thinner) the white border. It''s brightness competes for attention.</td>', 'Nicely done. The detail on the glass is a nice touch. Like the composition as well. As a suggestion, tone down (darker or make thinner) the white border. It''s brightness competes for attention.', '2010-11-16 20:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224883, 918320, 10275, '<td valign="top">There is so much detail in this photo. The colours are great and it is so well lit. The background is perfect. The only thing I would just completely avoid is the border. It doesn''t really improve the image, it takes away from it.</td>', 'There is so much detail in this photo. The colours are great and it is so well lit. The background is perfect. The only thing I would just completely avoid is the border. It doesn''t really improve the image, it takes away from it.', '2010-11-16 20:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224888, 918857, 10275, '<td valign="top">This is a unique idea and well composed image. I love the way the sharpness fades into the background. Too bad the clover is not sharp. Your lens might have been too close to it for good sharpness. Also try making the border dark green. The black doesn''t fit with the rest of the soft colours.</td>', 'This is a unique idea and well composed image. I love the way the sharpness fades into the background. Too bad the clover is not sharp. Your lens might have been too close to it for good sharpness. Also try making the border dark green. The black doesn''t fit with the rest of the soft colours.', '2010-11-16 20:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224891, 919109, 10275, '<td valign="top">Beautiful strong colours. The leaf is a bit overexposed (blown out highlights). Also, when you photograph on such a dark surface, watch out for dirt (give it a quick blow, before you put down the leaf).</td>', 'Beautiful strong colours. The leaf is a bit overexposed (blown out highlights). Also, when you photograph on such a dark surface, watch out for dirt (give it a quick blow, before you put down the leaf).', '2010-11-16 20:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224893, 918625, 10275, '<td valign="top">Neat idea. I don''t mind the grain of the image, but would suggest cropping off about three quartrs of an inch from the bottom to get rid of the yellow reflection.</td>', 'Neat idea. I don''t mind the grain of the image, but would suggest cropping off about three quartrs of an inch from the bottom to get rid of the yellow reflection.', '2010-11-16 20:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224895, 919131, 10275, '<td valign="top">Nicely handled lighting and colour. The green is pleasing, not overpowering. You need to work on your composition. Try the flower on an angle (diagonals make great line compositions). In this case, you needed a bit more space on the left, as the flower is almost touching the edge. Also, the border doesn''t need to be that thick. It doesn''t help the image. Nice thin one would have been quite enough. 7</td>', 'Nicely handled lighting and colour. The green is pleasing, not overpowering. You need to work on your composition. Try the flower on an angle (diagonals make great line compositions). In this case, you needed a bit more space on the left, as the flower is almost touching the edge. Also, the border doesn''t need to be that thick. It doesn''t help the image. Nice thin one would have been quite enough. 7', '2010-11-16 21:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224896, 918916, 10275, '<td valign="top">Cool thing. Like the lighting.</td>', 'Cool thing. Like the lighting.', '2010-11-16 21:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224898, 918180, 10275, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of a rose. A bit overexposed highlights, but nice contrast between darks and lights. To make it even better and stronger image, I suggest cropping off the top and right parts of the image. The over-exposed rose bud at top right is a distraction, as is the cut of bud above the rose.</td>', 'Nice shot of a rose. A bit overexposed highlights, but nice contrast between darks and lights. To make it even better and stronger image, I suggest cropping off the top and right parts of the image. The over-exposed rose bud at top right is a distraction, as is the cut of bud above the rose.', '2010-11-16 21:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224902, 919009, 10275, '<td valign="top">Neat idea and strong colours. Smart use of a car as a background. To make it into a better image, do not chop off the bottom part of the plant and on the left you are getting too close to the edge. Also, the top part being brighter than the rest, throws it out of balance. Perhaps, moving further away from the car, and letting the background go soft, you might have had enough dark space for the plant. If you try this on a cloudy day, it will eliminate the contrast problem between dark and light.</td>', 'Neat idea and strong colours. Smart use of a car as a background. To make it into a better image, do not chop off the bottom part of the plant and on the left you are getting too close to the edge. Also, the top part being brighter than the rest, throws it out of balance. Perhaps, moving further away from the car, and letting the background go soft, you might have had enough dark space for the plant. If you try this on a cloudy day, it will eliminate the contrast problem between dark and light.', '2010-11-16 21:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224905, 917986, 10275, '<td valign="top">To make this even stronger image, crop it about an inch below the person (just above the first connector of the pipe). Otherwise lovely image.</td>', 'To make this even stronger image, crop it about an inch below the person (just above the first connector of the pipe). Otherwise lovely image.', '2010-11-16 21:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224906, 918990, 10275, '<td valign="top">Great moment shot and the colours are very cool. This is a bit over the top with the tilt. Just a bit less of an angle would have made this quite good.</td>', 'Great moment shot and the colours are very cool. This is a bit over the top with the tilt. Just a bit less of an angle would have made this quite good.', '2010-11-16 21:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224908, 918514, 10275, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait and nice composition. You are missing the second complementary colour (her skin is not orange enough :)), but still nicely done.</td>', 'Beautiful portrait and nice composition. You are missing the second complementary colour (her skin is not orange enough :)), but still nicely done.', '2010-11-16 21:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224912, 919167, 10275, '<td valign="top">This is a great stock photography image. You even have enough space on the top left for advertising text :) 9</td>', 'This is a great stock photography image. You even have enough space on the top left for advertising text :) 9', '2010-11-16 21:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224913, 918661, 10275, '<td valign="top">This image is perfect in every way possible. I would not change a thing. This is my selection for a blue ribbon. 10</td>', 'This image is perfect in every way possible. I would not change a thing. This is my selection for a blue ribbon. 10', '2010-11-16 21:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224914, 918842, 10275, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous! The sky is superb. Nice depth as well.</td>', 'Gorgeous! The sky is superb. Nice depth as well.', '2010-11-16 21:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224916, 918958, 10275, '<td valign="top">Well done. Lovely crown. But you really don''t need the border or at least make it thinner.</td>', 'Well done. Lovely crown. But you really don''t need the border or at least make it thinner.', '2010-11-16 21:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224917, 919130, 10275, '<td valign="top">Great candid shot. Nicely handled lighting. The detail is amazing. 10</td>', 'Great candid shot. Nicely handled lighting. The detail is amazing. 10', '2010-11-16 21:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224918, 918444, 24511, '<td valign="top">Not too sure about the corner white tape looking lines but loved the color contrast and miror reflection.  Little red dot on car a curiosity.  First time I give high score for my 1st rated this challenge. 7 and hoping the others are just as good as yours.  Thanks.</td>', 'Not too sure about the corner white tape looking lines but loved the color contrast and miror reflection.  Little red dot on car a curiosity.  First time I give high score for my 1st rated this challenge. 7 and hoping the others are just as good as yours.  Thanks.', '2010-11-16 21:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224919, 918947, 10275, '<td valign="top">Funky! Very "matrix" like. Nice composition and colors. Should be amongst the top ones.</td>', 'Funky! Very "matrix" like. Nice composition and colors. Should be amongst the top ones.', '2010-11-16 21:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224921, 919174, 24511, '<td valign="top">Loved the whole setup and reflections.  I found the grapes too close to primary red instead of purples otherwise I would have voted much, much higher.</td>', 'Loved the whole setup and reflections.  I found the grapes too close to primary red instead of purples otherwise I would have voted much, much higher.', '2010-11-16 21:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224922, 918057, 10275, '<td valign="top">Great stock image. Strong composition. It''s simple and very effective. I can see this as a great advertisement for a food company.</td>', 'Great stock image. Strong composition. It''s simple and very effective. I can see this as a great advertisement for a food company.', '2010-11-16 21:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224924, 918655, 10275, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites. Simple, effective, with pleasing color. It is a piece of art. I can see this hanging on someone''s wall. 10</td>', 'This is one of my favorites. Simple, effective, with pleasing color. It is a piece of art. I can see this hanging on someone''s wall. 10', '2010-11-16 21:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224929, 919133, 10275, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done. Sensual and appetizing. Border is OK, could be thinner by one pixel. Neat advertising image with space above the subject for text :)</td>', 'Beautifully done. Sensual and appetizing. Border is OK, could be thinner by one pixel. Neat advertising image with space above the subject for text :)', '2010-11-16 21:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224930, 919082, 24511, '<td valign="top">Whoa now this is definition of complementary colors.  Crafty composition.  My screne is warped or the line on the glass is slightly wobbly.  Every other line is so perfect it stands out.  Great shot.</td>', 'Whoa now this is definition of complementary colors.  Crafty composition.  My screne is warped or the line on the glass is slightly wobbly.  Every other line is so perfect it stands out.  Great shot.', '2010-11-16 21:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224933, 918016, 10275, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous sky colors. Lovely silluette. The moon is nice touch.</td>', 'Gorgeous sky colors. Lovely silluette. The moon is nice touch.', '2010-11-16 21:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224935, 919169, 121949, '<td valign="top">Love the soft oranges and blues. Great perpective. One of my top picks.</td>', 'Love the soft oranges and blues. Great perpective. One of my top picks.', '2010-11-16 21:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224936, 919185, 10275, '<td valign="top">Just stunning image. One of top contenders. Gallery quality photo (without the border :))</td>', 'Just stunning image. One of top contenders. Gallery quality photo (without the border :))', '2010-11-16 21:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224937, 918655, 121949, '<td valign="top">Love this one. Wish the purple was a little more purple, but never the less you are one of my top picks.</td>', 'Love this one. Wish the purple was a little more purple, but never the less you are one of my top picks.', '2010-11-16 21:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224938, 919074, 24511, '<td valign="top">Your Xmas color clasic combination hints at romance or relationship.  I loved the subtle red reflection on the dark surface.  A bit of orange in the red kept your score from springing to the top.  I liked this one.  Not too busy with lines, curbs and texture.  Good luck</td>', 'Your Xmas color clasic combination hints at romance or relationship.  I loved the subtle red reflection on the dark surface.  A bit of orange in the red kept your score from springing to the top.  I liked this one.  Not too busy with lines, curbs and texture.  Good luck', '2010-11-16 21:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224939, 919169, 24511, '<td valign="top">Shame on you for such a lovely creation.  Double ten for me.</td>', 'Shame on you for such a lovely creation.  Double ten for me.', '2010-11-16 21:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224940, 918608, 24511, '<td valign="top">Sleek.  This is one that grows on me.  The more I look at it the more I like it.  I hate the background yet love the whole grouping of elements.  8 for me.  Thanks from a purple hater that has learned to see beyond the surface.  I''m off to get a drink now.</td>', 'Sleek.  This is one that grows on me.  The more I look at it the more I like it.  I hate the background yet love the whole grouping of elements.  8 for me.  Thanks from a purple hater that has learned to see beyond the surface.  I''m off to get a drink now.', '2010-11-16 21:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224944, 919189, 24511, '<td valign="top">sorry no color no points</td>', 'sorry no color no points', '2010-11-16 21:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224950, 919167, 24511, '<td valign="top">U R Tubulastic.  I loved the inovative approach.  Best attention grabber for me so far.  Rating high 8.  Good luck.</td>', 'U R Tubulastic.  I loved the inovative approach.  Best attention grabber for me so far.  Rating high 8.  Good luck.', '2010-11-16 21:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224952, 919028, 24511, '<td valign="top">Without the red I would have given you a twenty.  I love guitars.  Good luck.</td>', 'Without the red I would have given you a twenty.  I love guitars.  Good luck.', '2010-11-16 21:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224959, 918305, 24511, '<td valign="top">I sometimes hate busy and loved some of the other simple in your face designs with impact but your photo is so very interesting I could waldo it forever.  Loved it and the challenge colors are very prominent. High 9 and favorite.  Thanks.</td>', 'I sometimes hate busy and loved some of the other simple in your face designs with impact but your photo is so very interesting I could waldo it forever.  Loved it and the challenge colors are very prominent. High 9 and favorite.  Thanks.', '2010-11-16 21:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224966, 918449, 24511, '<td valign="top">Hate orange but it is worth the staring into such beautiful eyes.  Second ten for me.</td>', 'Hate orange but it is worth the staring into such beautiful eyes.  Second ten for me.', '2010-11-16 21:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224972, 919130, 24511, '<td valign="top">My favorite.  Ten and challenge winner in my book.</td>', 'My favorite.  Ten and challenge winner in my book.', '2010-11-16 21:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224973, 918352, 24511, '<td valign="top">What is going on.  This is my third or fourth ten this challenge.  Congrats.</td>', 'What is going on.  This is my third or fourth ten this challenge.  Congrats.', '2010-11-16 21:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224979, 918982, 24511, '<td valign="top">Great photo but complementary colors not obvious.  Sorry I would have added purple for the yellow or blue for the orange.  Good luck</td>', 'Great photo but complementary colors not obvious.  Sorry I would have added purple for the yellow or blue for the orange.  Good luck', '2010-11-16 21:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224984, 919089, 24511, '<td valign="top">I see a variety of complementary colors and believe this to be the best of the best for nailing the challenge.  Top ten and added to favorite.  Congratulations.</td>', 'I see a variety of complementary colors and believe this to be the best of the best for nailing the challenge.  Top ten and added to favorite.  Congratulations.', '2010-11-16 22:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
