(6225259, 918298, 54645, '<td valign="top">Ha! I contemplated this image for quite some time. I was drawn by the wicked shadows; I still wonder whose blood those shadows threw upon the wall.</td>', 'Ha! I contemplated this image for quite some time. I was drawn by the wicked shadows; I still wonder whose blood those shadows threw upon the wall.', '2010-11-17 00:41:32.000000', NULL, 0),
