(6225335, 918661, 88850, '<td valign="top">Well done, Deb!!</td>', 'Well done, Deb!!', '2010-11-17 01:12:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(6225343, 918655, 25355, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the ribbon. I like purple and yellow together.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Magnum_za:</b></div><hr/><i> I''m so pleased for you. I am really surprised it did so well not because of the quality of work but I''d thought the noise would be knocked down. Well done. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>At first I thought it was noise, but it''s more likely to be the quality of the paper.</td>', 'Congratulations on the ribbon. I like purple and yellow together. Originally posted by Magnum_za: I''m so pleased for you. I am really surprised it did so well not because of the quality of work but I''d thought the noise would be knocked down. Well done.   At first I thought it was noise, but it''s more likely to be the quality of the paper.', '2010-11-17 01:14:13.000000', NULL, 0),
