(6225764, 919174, 91944, '<td valign="top">Yeah, I thought since they are called purple grapes, and since they look purple under certain lighting, that they could pass, but in this picture they do look a bit red, sorry about that. But i think the results turned out pretty good considering this is my first challenge, and i have no real photographic training, or experience. I honestly was expecting last place. Thanks to all who gave me a fair rating.Was there any editing i could have done to make this look more purple???<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-11-17 10:48:38.</i></td>', 'Yeah, I thought since they are called purple grapes, and since they look purple under certain lighting, that they could pass, but in this picture they do look a bit red, sorry about that. But i think the results turned out pretty good considering this is my first challenge, and i have no real photographic training, or experience. I honestly was expecting last place. Thanks to all who gave me a fair rating.Was there any editing i could have done to make this look more purple???', '2010-11-17 10:46:27.000000', '2010-11-17 10:48:38.000000', 0),
