(6227107, 919082, 8643, '<td valign="top">As one of those who have contributed to the generation of this so-called cliché - with my only blue - this a worthy winner.  Maybe it has been done before but the execution is flawless and achieving it takes a great deal of time, patience and attention to detail.  As for those who grumble about curvature and suchlike, this is a photography contest, not a drawing competition.  If it was geometrically perfect, it would not look real!<br/>Congratulations to rio78.</td>', 'As one of those who have contributed to the generation of this so-called cliché - with my only blue - this a worthy winner.  Maybe it has been done before but the execution is flawless and achieving it takes a great deal of time, patience and attention to detail.  As for those who grumble about curvature and suchlike, this is a photography contest, not a drawing competition.  If it was geometrically perfect, it would not look real!Congratulations to rio78.', '2010-11-18 16:40:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(6227347, 918444, 30982, '<td valign="top">I wondered where this went - quite liked it during voting.  And yeah, that looks like some sort of odd artifact rather than an edited feature.  Sorry about the DQ, but I do wonder how the artifact got created.  Still a lovely shot!</td>', 'I wondered where this went - quite liked it during voting.  And yeah, that looks like some sort of odd artifact rather than an edited feature.  Sorry about the DQ, but I do wonder how the artifact got created.  Still a lovely shot!', '2010-11-18 22:46:21.000000', NULL, 0),
