(6227877, 918661, 61961, '<td valign="top">Seeing this entry with new eyes, I wish I could raise my vote.  I''m afraid on the first go-round all I saw was "another sunset" photo!  The more I look at it the more I like it.  The bird reference in your title is apt -- it''s like it was painted with a feather.</td>', 'Seeing this entry with new eyes, I wish I could raise my vote.  I''m afraid on the first go-round all I saw was "another sunset" photo!  The more I look at it the more I like it.  The bird reference in your title is apt -- it''s like it was painted with a feather.', '2010-11-19 13:46:38.000000', NULL, 0),
