(6230436, 919082, 87808, '<td valign="top">What a totally perfect shot this is.  This is outstanding, the colours the crispness, the edge, you have done well. Ignore anyone that says this is overdone.  You did it a different way, it is new for you, so that in it''s self makes it a winner.  I wish I could do something this well. Well done mate</td>', 'What a totally perfect shot this is.  This is outstanding, the colours the crispness, the edge, you have done well. Ignore anyone that says this is overdone.  You did it a different way, it is new for you, so that in it''s self makes it a winner.  I wish I could do something this well. Well done mate', '2010-11-22 22:04:39.000000', NULL, 0),
